WEBVTT

00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:06.800
Nope, this isn't going to work.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.150
Drat!

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.990
What do you think, Uriel?

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:16.620
Did I move too much, too soon?

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.320
It was...

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:21.620
I really blew it.

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:23.790
Jeanne is on her way!

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:26.160
Demons, intercept her!

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.450
I'll leave it at that for today.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:53.060
If I have to breathe Hell's 
foul air much longer,

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:57.240
even the glorious body His Holiness
Michael gave me will be tainted.

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:03.590
I should've known that a girl of her purity

00:01:03.590 --> 00:01:06.640
wouldn't be able to withstand 
the air in Hell for long.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:13.630
But you can't win the game if you 
don't use your pawns correctly.

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:19.410
Perhaps I should've sent you along, Uriel...

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:24.540
Instead of tasking you to bestow the ecstasy.

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:29.440
It's too bad, Uriel.

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:32.490
It's truly too bad.

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:44.070
Holy Michael...

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:41.690
Now, regarding the recent invasion 
of Hell by Heaven's forces...

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:43.810
How deplorable that was.

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:48.450
If Camio hadn't fought them off,
who knows what might've happened?

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:53.460
He is the leader, so it's only right 
that he should fight on the front line.

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:57.800
Besides, I believe it was Sytry who 
first warned us of the invasion.

00:03:58.240 --> 00:04:02.750
Quibbling over whose heroic act 
was greatest won't solve anything.

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:05.010
True enough.

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:10.470
Moving on, the real problem here is
that Heaven's real target wasn't Hell,

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:13.220
but the Elector.

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:18.890
That detestable virgin's invasion was 
nothing more than a diversion,

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:22.740
as I'm sure you're all aware.

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:25.530
What exactly are you getting at?

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:32.660
I believe that leaving him in the 
human world is too dangerous.

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:35.090
If they get him,

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:37.920
not only will we have no means 
for choosing an interim emperor,

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:41.630
but Heaven will have control 
of Solomon's powers, as well.

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:47.390
You're proposing we bring the 
Elector to Hell, is that it?

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:52.390
I'm told that the present-day Solomon 
is entirely dismissive of us demons.

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:57.980
The Elector must be relocated to a place 
where we can keep an eye on him.

00:04:58.300 --> 00:05:03.060
First you try to kill him yourself, 
now you want to protect him?

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:05.530
What brought on this change of heart?

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:09.200
Did I do such a thing?

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:12.960
You're only after his life, aren't you?

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:15.630
If you're worried about him,

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:18.000
it's all the more reason to call him to Hell.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:18.630
What?

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:24.020
You'd feel more secure if you 
could monitor him personally, no?

00:05:26.690 --> 00:05:28.370
<i>Clever bastard...</i>

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:33.970
I agree that bringing the Elector 
here is the right decision.

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:36.690
Beelzebub, you damned...

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:40.300
Lady Astaroth.

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:42.860
You should look after him.

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:49.870
Out of the four of us, you are 
the one most familiar with him.

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:53.280
Does that not make you best for the job?

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:59.580
My, that's certainly big of you, Lord Beelzebub.

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:03.340
I'll take that as a compliment.

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:09.250
Lamia.

00:06:10.150 --> 00:06:11.310
Tell William—

00:06:13.530 --> 00:06:17.520
Actually, Dantalion should be the first to know.

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:20.550
Where is Dantalion now?

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:23.480
I don't know, I haven't seen him in a while.

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:25.310
I miss him...

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:30.280
All right then, bring William straight here.

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:33.660
Find him and Dantalion won't be far behind.

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:38.760
Take William into custody?

00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:41.280
For how long?

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:43.270
How long?

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:47.100
I'm thinking, either until he elects you,

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:51.190
or until Heaven gives up on him.

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:53.930
But William might...

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:57.330
Don't worry about silly details.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:04.320
Sytry, it's not good for a 
puppet to have his own will.

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:08.730
You are my pretty little doll.

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:13.120
Just smile that beautiful smile and keep silent.

00:07:22.550 --> 00:07:23.740
Viscount Sytry...

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:28.480
Leave me be.

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:45.980
What was his name? Amadeus?

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:52.110
He was every bit as good a musician 
as you, maybe even better.

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:55.860
Cheerful man, had a 
wonderful sense of humor,

00:07:55.860 --> 00:08:00.410
but sadly he perished before I could
convince him to make a pact with me.

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:03.620
That's too bad.

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:07.010
Losing him taught me a lesson I will never forget.

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:10.520
Amadeus, Solomon...

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:13.630
No matter how skilled or 
talented a human may be,

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:16.410
they can vanish in the blink of an eye.

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:19.560
That's true.

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:33.300
Solomon's wisdom was deep, 
vast, and truly admirable.

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:41.320
I spent many long hours conversing
with him about all sorts of topics.

00:09:04.050 --> 00:09:08.730
I don't like the idea of Heaven coming 
into possession of that wisdom.

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:13.070
Then you agree with putting 
him under our protection?

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:24.840
Your report was absolutely superb.

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:27.590
Keep up the good work, Twining.

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:29.460
You can count on me, sir.

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:32.260
I will never betray your expectations.

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:33.540
Take care.

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:40.910
<i>One step closer to Oxbridge!</i>

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:43.310
I'm so great.

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:49.280
Ever since I took this ring, 
everything's been going my...

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:50.570
I mean...

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:55.000
Not that I believe in good 
luck charms or magic spells.

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:58.530
I'm only noting the statistics.

00:09:59.850 --> 00:10:03.860
Still obsessing over the 
silliest little things, huh?

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:05.950
Wh-Who are you?!

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:09.440
I'm Lamia, Dantalion's fiancée.

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:13.630
I came here for you on 
behalf of Lady Astaroth.

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:17.250
You're Dantalion's what?

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:20.450
Well, it's not official yet,

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:22.930
but it will be in the very near future.

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:27.140
This information has no application 
to my brilliant future.

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:29.050
<i>There. Deleted.</i>

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:30.920
Wait a minute!

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:32.320
I need to talk to you!

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:33.610
Well, I don't!

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:34.860
Jeez...

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:36.740
Just come with me!

00:10:58.780 --> 00:11:02.470
What is this, another stupid costume party?

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:08.680
Sytry and the Head Boy, 
what're you two doing here?

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:14.070
This is our first meeting, 
Elector William Twining.

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:19.410
I am Samael, ruler of Limbo and the East.

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:20.280
Wha—

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:24.040
King of the North, Beelzebub.

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:29.040
Ruler of Tartarus and King 
of the West, Baalberith.

00:11:29.940 --> 00:11:35.000
Dantalion's master and Grand 
Duchess of the South, Astaroth.

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:36.710
What do you people want?

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:40.260
I've got a report to write, 
so hurry up and send me back.

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:43.720
You're still whining about such silly things?

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:46.890
Please don't be in such a rush.

00:11:47.590 --> 00:11:49.730
Would you care for some tea?

00:11:50.010 --> 00:11:53.640
Perhaps a light snack?

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:58.470
I can make you a sandwich 
or tart, or even ice cream.

00:11:59.160 --> 00:12:02.780
We've got teas from all 
over the world, as well.

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:08.830
We brought you here for your own protection.

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:10.790
Huh? My protection?

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:14.910
Heaven is still targeting you.

00:12:15.810 --> 00:12:19.600
Heaven... As in God and angels and whatnot?

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:21.410
What else would it mean?

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:28.020
Elector, your powers are so great, they
have spurred Heaven itself into action.

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:30.830
I am not the Elector.

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:34.310
Therefore, I have no powers worth targeting.

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:36.400
I rest my case.

00:12:38.390 --> 00:12:42.440
You carry Solomon's blood in 
your veins, and that's a fact.

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:46.470
Even if I do, he lived thousands of years ago.

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:49.760
Such a distant ancestor means nothing to me.

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:53.630
Does not the fact that you 
deny it so vehemently

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:59.630
only prove your awareness that 
you are, in fact, the Elector?

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:00.890
What?

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:05.340
If it really meant nothing to you, 
you'd have no reason to deny it.

00:13:06.780 --> 00:13:10.650
A, B, or C, or pick a name
out of a hat if you like.

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:16.010
Just pick someone. 
Whomever it is, they'll protect you.

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:22.150
Although I suspect that this, too, 
is something that "means nothing" to you.

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:25.460
Don't tell me what to do.

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:28.050
I make my own decisions.

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:33.160
That includes this decision you 
all keep pestering me to make!

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:37.390
Curse you! If you weren't an old friend

00:13:37.390 --> 00:13:39.880
of His Highness Lucifer,
you'd pay for your tone!

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:44.340
What? Old friend? I don't even know him.

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:46.550
You dare mock our Emperor?!

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:49.510
Elector or not, I won't stand for this!

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:51.260
Everyone, calm down!

00:13:52.610 --> 00:13:54.810
Lowly human!

00:14:00.780 --> 00:14:01.900
William!

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:08.280
What's going on here?

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:11.460
Dantalion!

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:13.910
I knew you'd show up.

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:17.800
Are you okay, William?

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:20.080
Y-Yeah...

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:29.830
That ring...

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:34.100
No mistaking it. That is 
Solomon's "Ring of Wisdom."

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:36.870
Right in front of us...

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:42.960
The ring... If he didn't have that...

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:45.360
He couldn't control any of us.

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:47.730
There'd be nothing to fear.

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:50.720
What about it?

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:54.270
This is a Twining family heirloom. 
I won't let anyone have it.

00:14:54.690 --> 00:14:57.300
The ring... If he didn't have that...

00:14:57.870 --> 00:14:59.040
If we took it...

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:02.250
We might even be able to control Heaven.

00:15:04.770 --> 00:15:06.320
Be still, all of you!

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:12.270
The ring... If he didn't have that...

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:14.420
He couldn't control any of us.

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:15.590
There'd be nothing to fear.

00:15:19.150 --> 00:15:20.060
Stop this!

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:22.020
I told you, it's a family heirloom!

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:26.940
William!

00:15:29.520 --> 00:15:32.450
This presence, it can't be...

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:36.160
Looks like he put on the ring.

00:15:38.050 --> 00:15:39.580
And it's your fault.

00:15:57.320 --> 00:15:58.350
<i>You...</i>

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:00.390
<i>What have you done to me?!</i>

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:05.300
<i>As my first pillar, you are a particularly notable.</i>

00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:08.710
<i>The Eminent Grand Duke, Dantalion.</i>

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:11.300
<i>Or...</i>

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:13.740
<i>"The Flutist."</i>

00:16:15.260 --> 00:16:17.160
<i>How did you know that?!</i>

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:20.230
<i>Just sit back and watch.</i>

00:16:21.720 --> 00:16:24.220
<i>You'll have more companions 
before you know it.</i>

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:35.130
Well, well...

00:16:35.980 --> 00:16:38.040
It's been eons,

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:40.890
Solomon.

00:16:41.690 --> 00:16:42.800
Solomon?

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:47.360
Ah, I see.

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:51.130
He hasn't fully awakened yet.

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:58.280
Making this the perfect chance to take
both his soul and the ring in one shot.

00:16:58.510 --> 00:16:59.520
What?!

00:16:59.920 --> 00:17:04.190
A pitiful human should 
never have been given

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:06.710
the right to choose Hell's 
ruler in the first place.

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:11.290
If we take his soul, 
the Elector himself will vanish.

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:16.680
And if he doesn't have his ring, 
the era of Solomon's rule will finally end.

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:22.640
Now is the time for us 
demons to truly be free!

00:17:24.950 --> 00:17:26.100
Uncle!

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:28.150
What are you going to do?!

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:35.450
Wha—

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:38.620
Uncle's powers aren't working on him?

00:17:39.230 --> 00:17:42.750
He wiped out the whole crowd 
in the blink of an eye.

00:17:46.470 --> 00:17:49.490
By my name and by my 
wisdom, I command thee.

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:55.470
Thou shalt obey.

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:56.680
William!

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:04.640
Uncle!

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:15.110
What is this power?

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:20.520
Is that how he subjugated 
the seventy-two pillars?!

00:18:21.630 --> 00:18:25.200
That's the Lesser Key of Solomon!

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:29.590
So, no ordinary power is a match for him.

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:33.500
But we are in Hell, and I have 
unlimited pawns to sacrifice!

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:35.910
Do not fear him!

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:40.370
Whoever takes the ring will 
be granted enormous power!

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:44.970
Uncle, please stop this!

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:54.230
I'm doing this for your sake, too, my little doll.

00:18:55.590 --> 00:19:01.040
If we have Solomon's soul and his ring, 
it will be our ticket to Heaven.

00:19:02.530 --> 00:19:05.790
You long to return, don't you?

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:11.390
Did you think I couldn't tell, Sytry?

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:22.850
Is he trying to eradicate Hell itself?

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:25.740
Deploy a legion to the gates of Hell!

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:29.800
At this rate, Heaven will 
sense Solomon's revival!

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:34.400
<i>And then we'll have an all-out war over him.</i>

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:41.510
<i>Has Solomon truly been resurrected?</i>

00:19:43.880 --> 00:19:46.380
Obey me, sinners.

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:49.150
Salamander, shine glorious.

00:19:49.970 --> 00:19:51.980
Wave, Undine, as bidden.

00:19:53.110 --> 00:19:55.490
Sylph, be thou hidden.

00:19:56.690 --> 00:19:59.420
Gnome, be laborious.

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:11.190
Wow, you're really something, Solomon.

00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:15.810
As I would expect of one blessed by God.

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:19.370
You... What are you planning to do?

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:23.490
Chances like this don't come often.

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:28.490
I'm going to crush Solomon and raise my rank.

00:20:30.740 --> 00:20:33.480
Bonjour, Solomon.

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:39.590
No one else could have brought 
this much destruction to Hell.

00:20:40.400 --> 00:20:44.090
But I have my own issues 
to deal with, you see...

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:47.470
You won't mind dying for me, will you?!

00:20:52.270 --> 00:20:54.560
Well, well. Here's a new face.

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:57.080
Y-You...

00:20:57.080 --> 00:21:00.900
You must have descended to Hell after I died.

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:06.930
Would you like to become 
my seventy-third pillar?

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:21.500
Why, if it isn't Astaroth!

00:21:22.780 --> 00:21:24.380
You're looking well.

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:29.810
Sytry and Camio, too.

00:21:31.800 --> 00:21:36.130
Imagine, all of you together.
Are we having a dinner party?

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:46.460
Baalberith, it's been so long.

00:21:46.460 --> 00:21:47.750
I've missed you.

00:21:49.580 --> 00:21:50.680
Solomon...

00:21:52.220 --> 00:21:54.410
At this rate, William will...

00:21:57.800 --> 00:21:59.690
<i>If I can get this off...</i>

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:08.000
And who are you?

00:23:40.660 --> 00:23:41.850
I'm Amon!

00:23:41.850 --> 00:23:42.900
And I'm Mamon!

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:45.460
Believers and non-believers,

00:23:45.460 --> 00:23:48.850
we're always fluttering just behind you!

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:50.740
I'm Amon!

00:23:50.740 --> 00:23:51.580
And I'm Mamon!

00:23:51.580 --> 00:23:52.820
Even if you can't see us,

00:23:52.820 --> 00:23:54.700
we're always by your side!
